{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T16:52:11+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-10-28T16:52:11+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"Pharming Group N.V.","sector":"Healthcare","industry":"Biotechnology","country":"Netherlands","city":"Leiden","website":"https://www.pharming.com","employees":407,"summary":"Pharming Group N.V., a biopharmaceutical company, develops and commercializes protein replacement therapies and precision medicines for the treatment of rare diseases in the United States, Europe, and internationally. The company's lead product is RUCONEST, a recombinant C1 esterase inhibitor for the treatment of acute attacks in adult and adolescent patients with acute hereditary angioedema (HAE); and Joenja (leniolisib), an oral small molecule PI3Kd inhibitor for the treatment of activated phosphoinositide 3-kinase delta syndrome. It also develops Joenja, an oral small molecule PI3Kd inhibitor. It has a development collaboration and license agreement with Novartis. Pharming Group N.V. was incorporated in 1988 and is headquartered in Leiden, the Netherlands.","exchange":"Amsterdam","currency":"EUR","financial_currency":"USD","summary_fr":"Pharming Group N.V., une société biopharmaceutique, développe et commercialise des thérapies de remplacement des protéines et des médicaments de précision pour le traitement des maladies rares aux États-Unis, en Europe et à l'international. Le principal produit de la société est RUCONEST, un inhibiteur recombinant de la C1 estérase pour le traitement des crises aiguës chez les patients adultes et adolescents atteints d'angioedème héréditaire aigu (AOH); et Joenja (leniolisib), un inhibiteur oral de la petite molécule PI3Kd pour le traitement du syndrome delta de la 3-kinase phosphoinositide activée. Il développe également Joenja, un inhibiteur oral de petite molécule PI3Kd."},"valuation":{"market_cap_yahoo":770419904,"shares_outstanding